        <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML><DEFINITION><ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>ad-text</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF></DEFINITION><THE-VALUE><xhtml:div>The system shall render a weighted score. See steps below:<xhtml:ol><xhtml:li>collect inputs</xhtml:li><xhtml:li>weight them</xhtml:li></xhtml:ol><xhtml:table><xhtml:tr><xhtml:td colspan="2">Summary (merged)</xhtml:td></xhtml:tr><xhtml:tr><xhtml:td>Weight</xhtml:td><xhtml:td>0.8</xhtml:td></xhtml:tr></xhtml:table>See also <xhtml:a href="https://example.com/spec#sec-3">external spec section 3</xhtml:a>.</xhtml:div></THE-VALUE></ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
